  "question": {
    "text": "The solution of the differential equation <math><mi>x</mi><mi></mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is<br />\r(where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math> is an arbitrary constant)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "p9ThA",
      "text": "<math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "8iKxn",
      "text": "<math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NMJ4K",
      "text": "<math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "GEUPV",
      "text": "<math><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given differential equation can be written as,</p><p><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8901;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Integrating factor is <math><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>.</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br />Hence, the solution is <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
